  "description_short": "Laid-back burgers and coffee spot in Sedgefield serving American comfort food with local heart.",
  "description_long": "Tucked into the N2 Centre on Sedgefield's main service road, Kahuna's brings a relaxed American-style eatery vibe to this Garden Route town. The menu centres on proper burgers and comfort food done well, with decent coffee to fuel your pit stop or leisurely breakfast. It's the kind of place where locals drop in for takeaways and travellers pull off the highway for a satisfying meal without fuss.\n\nThe casual atmosphere suits families, road-trippers, and anyone after straightforward food that hits the spot. With a 4.8-star rating from nearly 100 reviews, Kahuna's has clearly found its groove in Sedgefield's dining scene. Whether you're grabbing coffee and a bite before exploring the lagoon, or settling in for burgers with the crew, it delivers honest flavours without pretension.",
